# Rust
/target/
**/target/

# Cargo.lock IS committed deliberately — HR-12.5 requires two builds of the same
# commit to be byte-identical, and that is impossible without pinned dependency
# versions. Do not add it here.

# Go
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
/control/control
/control/admin

# Android / Gradle
.gradle/
**/build/
local.properties
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
*.jks

# Release artifacts and signing material.
# No private key may ever be committed (HR-0.3, WORKING-AGREEMENT §4).
# Public halves ARE committed on purpose — they are pinned into agent builds.
/dist/
*.sig
!keys/**/*.pub
!keys/**/*.pem.pub

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Playwright / Node (test tooling only — never a runtime dependency; HR-9.7 requires
# panel assets vendored and served locally, so nothing here ships)
node_modules/
panel/test-results/
panel/playwright-report/
